  "contentHtml": "\n<div><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/21046763.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s21046763.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--><br></div>23 жил дараалан зохион байгуулагддаг Дэлхийн хамгийн царай муутай хөгийн нохойны тэмцээн өндөрлөлөө. Урьд өмнө нь та бүхэнд бас 2010 оны ялагч нохойг танилцуулж байсан билээ. Харин энэ удаад 2010 оны хамгийн царай муутай хөгийн нохойны ялагч 14 настай Yoda хэмээх нохойны зургуудыг хүргэхээр боллоо. Chihuahua хэмээх хятад үүлдэрийн эрлийз нохой юм байна. <br><div><br><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/25829386.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s25829386.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/59710747.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s59710747.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/78084759.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s78084759.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/10241864.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s10241864.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/52533712.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s52533712.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/85313611.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s85313611.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/95924477.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s95924477.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/96529254.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062322im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/25/s96529254.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG9--><br></div>",
  "contentText": "23 жил дараалан зохион байгуулагддаг Дэлхийн хамгийн царай муутай хөгийн нохойны тэмцээн өндөрлөлөө. Урьд өмнө нь та бүхэнд бас 2010 оны ялагч нохойг танилцуулж байсан билээ. Харин энэ удаад 2010 оны хамгийн царай муутай хөгийн нохойны ялагч 14 настай Yoda хэмээх нохойны зургуудыг хүргэхээр боллоо. Chihuahua хэмээх хятад үүлдэрийн эрлийз нохой юм байна.",
